[6.523453, "o", "24:static const uint32_t PAILLIER_KEY_SIZE = sizeof(elliptic_curve256_scalar_t) * 8 * 8; // size in bits\r\n25:static const uint32_t RING_PEDERSEN_KEY_SIZE = sizeof(elliptic_curve256_scalar_t) * 8 * 4; // size in bits\r\n"]
[6.523507, "o", "\r\n  -> Paillier: 32*8*8 = 2048 bits -> proof.A = 512 bytes\r\n  -> Ring-Pedersen: 32*8*4 = 1024 bits -> proof.S = 128 bytes\r\n  -> BUG: Only 128 of 512 bytes of A are hashed (75% missing)\r\n\r\n"]
